<small>AG COACHING FC</small><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p>How the AG Coaching FC club app uses your information. Last updated <?= date('j F Y', filemtime(__FILE__)) ?>.</p>
<h2>Who we are</h2><p>AG Coaching FC, run by Alfie Greenwood, is responsible for your information (the "data controller"). Contact: <a href="mailto:<?= HEAD_COACH_EMAIL ?>"><?= HEAD_COACH_EMAIL ?></a>. The app is built and looked after for the club by North Point Creative, who only use the information to keep the app running.</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2><ul><li><b>About you:</b> your name, email, mobile number and password (stored scrambled, nobody can read it).</li><li><b>About your child:</b> name, squad, shirt number, position, match stats, attendance, and the medical information, emergency contact and photo consent you choose to give.</li><li><b>Messages:</b> group chats and messages you send to the coaches.</li><li><b>Bookings and payments:</b> camps, 1-1s and events you book, and whether you've told us you've paid. Card details are handled by PayPal, never by the app.</li><li><b>App use:</b> when the app is opened, on what type of device, and when you last used it. We don't use advertising or tracking cookies.</li></ul>
<h2>Why we use it</h2><p>To run the club: organising matches, training, camps and 1-1s, keeping children safe (medical and emergency details), letting you know about changes, and keeping records of bookings and payments. We rely on our legitimate interest in running the club, and on your consent for medical details and photos.</p>
<h2>Who can see it</h2><div class="box"><p style="margin:0">Your contact details and your child's medical information are seen <b>only by the club's coaches</b>. Other parents and guardians only see children's first names, squad stats and messages posted in group chats. We never sell your information or share it for marketing.</p></div>
<h2>Where it's kept and for how long</h2><p>On the club's secure UK/EU web hosting (IONOS), with daily backups kept for 30 days and a weekly backup emailed to the club. We keep your information while your child is at the club and delete it when you leave or ask us to, unless we need to keep a record for longer (for example payment records).</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2><p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your information at any time. You can delete your own account in the app: <b>Profile → Delete my account</b>. You can withdraw consent for medical details or photos by updating your child's details or asking a coach. If you're unhappy, you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ico.org.uk).</p>
